==English==

===Pronunciation===
*: {{rhymes|ɛə(r)weɪ}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{golf}} the area between the [[tee]] and the [[green]], where the [[grass]] is cut short
# any [[tract]] of [[land]] free from [[obstacle]]s
# ([[military|Military]]) A channel either from [[offshore]], in a [[river]], or in a [[harbor]] that has enough [[depth]] to accommodate the [[draft]] of large [[vessel]]s.(JP 4-01.6)
# {{nautical}} a [[navigable]] [[channel]] in a [[harbour]], [[offshore]] etc; the usual [[course]] taken by [[vessel]]s in such places.

